<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-11-01T21:18:42.489Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 21:18:42 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Jordan launched air strikes against Syrian targets in retaliation for a church shooting, while Syrian officials denied any border clashes with Jordan and described border security as a shared responsibility. Syria’s foreign minister confirmed ongoing talks about joining the Mecca defence pact and another minister said accession was possible. A Syrian hacker received a 42‑month prison sentence for attacks on Western media and government targets. Jordanian security forces seized thermal balloons carrying weapons smuggled into Jordan in the Karak Governorate. The UCDP recorded 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxOMXVfVkFlUGYya1F1S09GMzdSMnNkaE9nbmkySGFtSkNHcklPRHdQblA5aEN1WDQ5QnVWb2czb3FocHNRalIwWXEzYl9NTzRJYTFUWGQ1NGpIR09EdkllVGd5QmpmZ21pd2dWRVpEczhvT3ZQUGpPaE1vdUpzN29kdzVTVWh1Uld6?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxNUnZYN3pDajdLZXp1ZVlXeF8xTDNIc04xR2tMRXFsUzZsZTh4ckszeDM0V3daV1haWE15THZRUU43QlhxUFZfLWp5Z05SQmVENzBEbGJEcHhRdDR2elJBM2ExRVN2NlNqRldidDJQdXBMLVBUc1BHY0JaZ25Yblpwd2hlRnF6ZEljb3p5d3VxVG9Ya0poeXJWZnEzUmZfclVwSTVROGdkZjJFdDIzczd3TzBja1UxUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxQU0RRb05jYnE3UEwtcjhCNXBrc1lOd29PNVhRTkQ2T2tmZmVJUFNOMFNjOUpvZ2VXTnp0TWEwYVA3czF0blpFRUg3bnpGSGUtenl2MFcweHZOUlRpSUVQXzd6WlB6TEk2bHFaWUhycWdOdGdlVFhsY2lwQmNtOEk4elMyZE95ZUhSWUJCb0RSX2RVLWdyS0EwNnAtRDdTZjVHcjZjam00ODVrdWUyQVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Genocide Watch&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE03VjhtaEs4WEs3a01pbV9BODVkazVQOUpuMjFTWTNsWUNSa2RRNEphNTgwSDI0cU1wNGh1eWVFbG1JeElYVXJmUQ?oc=5&quot;